--- !u!114 &93469538
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 93469537}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e36a870d2757d1145a04fb9536d0beb4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueManager
  dialogueLines:
  - name: 
    text: It's finally time for you to take on the family legacy, so I'll teach you
      how to properly pour and mix drinks to satisfy your customers.
    uncleSpeaking: 0
    dadSpeaking: 1
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
  - name: 
    text: They used to be my customers...
    uncleSpeaking: 0
    dadSpeaking: 1
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
  - name: 
    text: Anyway, I guess its time I actually teach you how to do this
    uncleSpeaking: 0
    dadSpeaking: 1
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
  - name: 
    text: 'Look at the skinny bottle and small glass on the right shelf.

      Those
      will return the other bottles and glasses to their original spot.'
    uncleSpeaking: 0
    dadSpeaking: 1
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
  - name: 
    text: 'See the bottle with the blue label over there?

      Wait, is that just
      water? Ok, well I guess we all have to start from somewhere'
    uncleSpeaking: 0
    dadSpeaking: 1
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
  - name: 
    text: 'Anyway, grab the bottle and use Q or E to rotate it.


      try to pour
      it into that cup.'
    uncleSpeaking: 0
    dadSpeaking: 1
    removeButtonsOnStart: 1
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 1
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
  - name: 
    text: Great job, I think you might be ready for the most difficult part of this
      job.
    uncleSpeaking: 0
    dadSpeaking: 1
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
  - name: 
    text: I'm loaning you my bottle of mysterious red liquid just for training, but
      you'll have to get your own after we're done here today.
    uncleSpeaking: 0
    dadSpeaking: 1
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 1
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
  - name: 
    text: anyway, you need to learn how to mix drinks, so, go ahead and pour some
      red and some blue in that cup.
    uncleSpeaking: 0
    dadSpeaking: 1
    removeButtonsOnStart: 1
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 1
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
  - name: 
    text: As you might expect, it turned into purple, which is my favorite flavor,
      so now, I'll show you how to give the drinks to customers.
    uncleSpeaking: 0
    dadSpeaking: 1
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
  - name: 
    text: Ok, now, put the drink on the tray in front of me and pop my thought bubble
      to give it to me.
    uncleSpeaking: 0
    dadSpeaking: 1
    removeButtonsOnStart: 1
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 1
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 1
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
  - name: 
    text: Great Job, I don't think there's anything else I can teach you
    uncleSpeaking: 0
    dadSpeaking: 1
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
  nextButton: {fileID: 1195183071}
  backButton: {fileID: 1245142687}
  typingDelay: 0.05
  redBottle: {fileID: 1735265644}
  dad: {fileID: 1688764153}
  dissapearingDad: {fileID: 1564906996}
  submitButton: {fileID: 68560186}
  orderManager: {fileID: 421655146}
  parentRect: {fileID: 0}
  uncleAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  dadAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  defaultAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  dadLerpDuration: 1.5
  movingCamera: {fileID: 0}
